<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SIDE BY SIDE / 杨铭宇</view><view class="title">放在一起 看看再选</view><view class="subtitle">最多比较3道菜，让预算、口味和排队情况一目了然。</view><view class="panel"><picker range="{{labels}}" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="select">{{labels[selected]||'暂无在售菜品'}}</picker><button class="primary mt" bindtap="add">加入对比</button></view><view class="compare-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="panel"><view class="row"><view><text class="big-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</text><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view></view><text class="price">¥{{item.price}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.windowName}} · {{item.diet}} · {{item.taste}} · {{item.spiceLabel}}</view><view class="row mt"><text>★ {{item.rating.score}} · {{item.rating.count}}条公开评价</text><text class="status l{{item.crowd.level}}">{{item.crowd.label}}</text></view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="primary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="plan">安排这道菜</button><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail">看详情</button><button class="small danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">移除</button></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">先选择菜品，加入你的对比清单。</view><view class="owner">筛选 推荐 榜单 对比负责人 · 杨铭宇</view></view>
